{"seq":7,"slug":"sustainable-net-zero-architecture","title":"可持续建筑与零碳设计","stage":"DONE","category":"architecture-urban","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture","rating":{"composite":3.72,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 可持续建筑与零碳设计 简介\n\n建筑是全球碳排放的最大单一来源之一，从建造到运行再到拆除，贯穿整个生命周期的能耗与排放，深刻影响着我们能否守住气候目标。本 hub 聚焦「可持续建筑与零碳设计」，把一座建筑如何走向净零排放这件事，拆成可理解、可落地的知识体系，既面向想入门的人，也服务于希望系统梳理脉络的实践者。\n\n之所以重要，是因为零碳不是某个单点技术，而是一整套相互牵制的决策链。保温做厚一点、玻璃换一种、热源从燃气改成热泵、混凝土配方调整，任何一个改动都会同时牵动成本、舒适度、碳账本与合规要求。看不清全局，就容易在局部最优里把整体推向更高的排放或更差的体验。这个 hub 的价值，正在于先把全局讲清楚，再深入每一条主线。\n\n整体脉络由四条主线构成，彼此层层递进。第一条是「碳核算与基础」：先学会算账——区分全生命周期碳与隐含碳、运行碳与能耗基准，并理解被动式设计如何在不依赖设备的前提下先把需求压下来。算清楚要减什么，后面的取舍才有依据。\n\n第二条是「能源与系统」：在需求被压低之后，如何用高性能围护结构、热泵与全面电气化、以及建筑一体化的可再生能源与储能，把剩余的能量需求干净地满足。这一条把建筑从「耗能体」一步步变成「产能与调节并存」的能源节点。\n\n第三条是「材料与循环」：把目光从运行阶段拉回到建造本身，关注低碳混凝土与钢材、木结构等生物基材料、循环建造与适应性再利用，以及对人体健康友好的室内材料。它回答的是隐含碳与资源循环的问题——少用、用对、可再用。\n\n第四条是「认证、政策与实践」：绿色建筑评级体系、净零相关的政策与规范、以及调试与性能验证，构成了把设计意图落到真实运行的最后一环。它确保前三条主线不止停留在图纸和承诺上，而是被度量、被验证、被合规地兑现。\n\n四条主线合起来，构成一条从「算账」到「减需求」、再到「换能源」「选材料」、最后「验证兑现」的完整路径。建议按顺序通读建立框架，再按自己的角色与项目阶段深入对应章节。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fundamentals-carbon","title":"可持续设计基础与碳核算","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"whole-life-and-embodied-carbon","title":"全生命周期碳与隐含碳核算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon/whole-life-and-embodied-carbon"},{"seq":2,"slug":"operational-carbon-and-energy-benchmarks","title":"运营碳与建筑能效基准 (Operational Carbon and Energy Benchmarks)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon/operational-carbon-and-energy-benchmarks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"passive-design-strategies","title":"被动式设计策略与气候适应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/fundamentals-carbon/passive-design-strategies"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"energy-and-systems","title":"建筑能源与系统电气化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"high-performance-envelope","title":"高性能围护结构与超低能耗","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems/high-performance-envelope"},{"seq":2,"slug":"building-integrated-renewables","title":"建筑光伏一体化与可再生能源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems/building-integrated-renewables"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hvac-electrification-heat-pumps","title":"暖通空调电气化与热泵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/energy-and-systems/hvac-electrification-heat-pumps"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"materials-circularity","title":"低碳材料与循环建造","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/materials-circularity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"low-carbon-materials-mass-timber","title":"低碳材料、低碳水泥与木结构","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/materials-circularity/low-carbon-materials-mass-timber"},{"seq":2,"slug":"circular-construction-adaptive-reuse","title":"循环建造与建筑适应性再利用","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/materials-circularity/circular-construction-adaptive-reuse"},{"seq":3,"slug":"healthy-materials-indoor-environment","title":"健康材料与室内环境质量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/materials-circularity/healthy-materials-indoor-environment"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"certification-policy-practice","title":"认证、政策与运维实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/certification-policy-practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"green-building-rating-systems","title":"绿色建筑认证体系：LEED/BREEAM/三星/WELL","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/certification-policy-practice/green-building-rating-systems"},{"seq":2,"slug":"net-zero-policy-and-codes","title":"零碳政策与建筑节能法规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/certification-policy-practice/net-zero-policy-and-codes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"commissioning-and-performance","title":"调试验证与运维性能优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/architecture-urban/sustainable-net-zero-architecture/certification-policy-practice/commissioning-and-performance"}]}]}